      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. some of those sound kinda superficial though... like the \"taxpayer\" thing feels a bit like a weak excuse. can you get into the more substantial legal or philosophical arguments they use? like the ones that actually hold up in academic or constitutional debates?",
      "source": "evaluator"
